&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner Strategy &amp;amp; Campaign Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with major restaurant partners to understand marketing objectives, propose tailored ad solutions, and coordinate campaign launches, management, and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
